      "message": "This looks like it will be hard to read if there is more than one VM running. It looks like other services use indentation to structure their dump output, and I think the same would make sense here. The CID is essentially the ID of the VM, so you could use that as a heading, and have something like:\n\n```\nVM CID 4:\n  state: RUNNING\n  ...\nVM CID 5:\n  state: READY\n  ...\n```",
